# Accepted vulnerabilities. Every entry needs an ADR and an expiry date; CI fails again
# automatically once an entry expires. See pip/docs/adr/026-spring-framework-6-2-eol-cves.md.

# Spring Framework 6.2.x (Spring Boot 3.5), no open-source fix on 6.2; fixed in 7.0.9.
# XsltView path traversal: event-core renders no views and has no XsltView.
CVE-2026-47884 exp:2026-12-31
# SSE stream corruption with view fragments: event-core's SSE sends JSON data, never view fragments.
CVE-2026-47890 exp:2026-12-31
